Cricket Coach 2014 — copyrighted artwork and audio
====================================================

Copied from a retail installation of Cricket Coach 2014
(Trade Derby Works / Big Ant Studios, 2014) for private, personal use.

NOT LICENSED FOR REDISTRIBUTION. Do not commit this directory to a public
remote, do not publish a build containing it, and do not relicense this project
in a way that would cover these files.

See THIRD-PARTY.md at the repository root.

Contents
--------
outcomes/  Outcome icons. Note there is no generic "W": the original shows how
           a batter was dismissed (BLD bowled, LBW, CT caught, RO run out,
           STM stumped), which this project reproduces.
shots/     Stroke sprites. Both the HD set (.png, partial) and the complete
           set (.bmp). Sprites suffixed _L are the left-handed mirror.
audio/     Crowd and bat sounds, sn_*.wav.

The original's database and commentary text were not copied. See
docs/cc2014-model.md.